  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senior Women Protection Advisor at UNJHRO 2017-2018 - Senior Women Protection Advsor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Senior r&#xe5;dgivare sexuellt v&#xe5;ld till UNJHRO 2017-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen best&#xe5;r av att bidra med en sekonderad person till UN Joint Human Rights Office (UNJHRO) p&#xe5; en senior P5 niv&#xe5; under 18 m&#xe5;nader. Detta ska m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r UNJHRO i Kinshasa att ge st&#xf6;d till implementeringen av handlingsplanen mot sexuellt v&#xe5;ld med FARDC (kongolesiska arm&#xe9;n) och personen ska leda arbetet med att implementera ett flertal FN resolutioner r&#xf6;rande konflikt relaterat sexuellt v&#xe5;ld.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy is proposing another secondment of a senior women protection advisor to UNJHRO during the period December 2016 - March 2019. During this phase, he/she will lead the implementation of Security Council Resolutions 1820; 1888; 1960; 2106 and 2242 on Conflict-Related Sexual Violence (CRSV) in the Democratic Republic of Congo and support the implementation of the FARDCs (the Congolse Army) Action Plan against sexual violance. The seconded person will be recruited by UNJHRO. The secondment will contribute to the result &quot;Strengthened capacity to prevent and alleviate the consequences of sexual and gender based violance&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the support to the Senior Women Protection Advisor is to advocate and support the government of DRC in reducing the levels of sexual violence by their armed forces and by other armed actors in the context of the armed conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
